## Third-Party Content

### Pre-recorded demo samples (`demo/samples/*.wav`)
The 6 audio files in `demo/samples/` are derived from the **TESS (Toronto
Emotional Speech Set)** dataset, which is licensed under
**Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)**.

These samples are included solely for non-commercial demonstration purposes.
- TESS citation: Dupuis, K., & Pichora-Fuller, M. K. (2010). *Toronto emotional
  speech set (TESS)*. University of Toronto, Psychology Department.
- License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

### Pre-trained model
`facebook/wav2vec2-base` by Meta AI (Baevski et al., 2020), released under
Apache License 2.0.
